| **Total Connection Capacity** | 300 | 900 (300 + 200 + 200 + 200) | 3x capacity |
| **P95 Query Latency** | 850ms | 280ms | 3x faster |
| **Primary CPU** | 85% | 35% | 70% offload |
| **Annual Enrollment Incidents** | 1 (2024: 12,400 timeouts) | 0 | ✓ Eliminated |

