[patterns/information/api-microservices/PTN-INF-API-003-read-replica-pattern.md#code-templates]

### Code Templates

**Connection Factory** (C#):

```csharp
public class DatabaseConnectionFactory
{
    private readonly NpgsqlDataSource _primaryPool;
    private readonly List<NpgsqlDataSource> _replicaPools;
    private int _replicaIndex = 0;

    public async Task<NpgsqlConnection> GetConnectionAsync(QueryContext context)
    {
        // Writes always go to primary
        if (context.IsWrite) return await _primaryPool.OpenConnectionAsync();

        // Check read-after-write window (5s)
        if (IsRecentWrite(context.EntityType, context.EntityId))
            return await _primaryPool.OpenConnectionAsync();

        // Round-robin across replicas
        var pool = _replicaPools[_replicaIndex];
        _replicaIndex = (_replicaIndex + 1) % _replicaPools.Count;
        return await pool.OpenConnectionAsync();
    }
}
```

**Replication Lag Monitoring** (SQL):

```sql
-- Monitor replication lag on PRIMARY
SELECT
  application_name AS replica_name,
  EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (NOW() - replay_timestamp)) AS lag_seconds,
  CASE
    WHEN EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (NOW() - replay_timestamp)) < 1 THEN '✓ Healthy'
    WHEN EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (NOW() - replay_timestamp)) < 5 THEN '⚠️ Warning'
    ELSE '❌ Critical'
  END AS status
FROM pg_stat_replication
ORDER BY lag_seconds DESC;
```
